
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Blog | Home</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="/" class="logo">my<span>blog.</span></a>

    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/posts">All Posts</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO MY CORNER OF THE INTERNET</p>

        <h1>Ideas worth<br><span>sharing.</span></h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
          A place for thoughts, stories, discoveries, and everything
          worth putting into words.
        </p>

        <a href="/posts" class="primary-button">
          Explore all posts <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <p class="hero-note">Read something interesting today.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-decoration" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="decoration-circle">
          <span>✳</span>
        </div>
        <div class="decoration-card">
          <span class="decoration-label">A LITTLE SPACE</span>
          <p>For big ideas<br>and honest words.</p>
          <span class="decoration-line"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-footer">
      <p>THOUGHTS. STORIES. PERSPECTIVES.</p>
      <a href="/posts">Discover the blog ↗</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
